<title>UK: EXEL to buy stake in Lloyds managing agency.</title>
<headline>EXEL to buy stake in Lloyds managing agency.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance company EXEL Ltd said on Monday it agreed to buy a 20 percent stake in a Lloyds of London managing agency, Venton Holdings Ltd, from Trident Partnership LP for $35 million.</p>
<p>EXEL said it would pay Trident $17.5 million in cash and put up letters of credit for an equivalent amount. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
